1
00:00:07,080 --> 00:00:08,920
SAY NO TO PIRACY, SUPPORT ORIGINALS

2
00:01:34,800 --> 00:01:38,920
ADAPTED FROM <i>JIA JIN CHAI</i>, ORIGINAL NOVEL
BY XIAOJIAREN ON JINJIANG LITERATURE CITY

3
00:01:47,120 --> 00:01:48,440
The sun's gone!

4
00:01:50,000 --> 00:01:51,360
Lu Zhuo!

5
00:01:51,440 --> 00:01:53,480
- Run!
- Everyone run!

6
00:01:53,560 --> 00:01:54,440
Lu Zhuo!

7
00:01:54,520 --> 00:01:56,200
- Get out!
- Run!

8
00:01:56,280 --> 00:01:57,240
Run!

9
00:01:57,320 --> 00:01:58,600
Leave now!

10
00:01:58,680 --> 00:01:59,520
Wei Rao!

11
00:02:00,080 --> 00:02:01,440
Hurry!

12
00:02:01,520 --> 00:02:04,840
- The sun's been swallowed!
- Run!

13
00:02:04,920 --> 00:02:06,360
What should we do?

14
00:02:06,440 --> 00:02:07,680
Move!

15
00:02:30,600 --> 00:02:31,440
Wei Rao!

16
00:03:24,160 --> 00:03:25,960
You knew everything outside was in chaos.

17
00:03:26,680 --> 00:03:29,720
You're always so careful,
so determined to protect yourself.

18
00:03:30,320 --> 00:03:32,200
Why did you throw yourself into the crowd?

19
00:03:33,760 --> 00:03:35,840
If the sun never rose again,

20
00:03:38,280 --> 00:03:40,800
I didn't want to die alone.

21
00:03:42,320 --> 00:03:44,360
I won't let you be alone.

22
00:03:53,800 --> 00:03:54,640
Wei Rao.

23
00:03:58,240 --> 00:03:59,520
How long do I have to wait?

24
00:04:01,320 --> 00:04:05,440
Right here, right now,
I can give you my answer.

25
00:04:42,080 --> 00:04:44,880
This is grander than
a royal princess's wedding!

26
00:04:44,960 --> 00:04:47,520
Her Ladyship is a blessing
to everyone she helps.

27
00:04:47,600 --> 00:04:49,520
She's truly blessed.

28
00:04:49,600 --> 00:04:51,200
To marry a woman like her,

29
00:04:51,280 --> 00:04:52,960
Lord Lu must be the luckiest man alive!

30
00:04:55,800 --> 00:04:58,080
A hero and a beauty,
a match made in heaven!

31
00:04:58,160 --> 00:04:59,520
Congratulations!

32
00:05:00,400 --> 00:05:02,800
May Her Ladyship and Lord Lu
stay together forever

33
00:05:02,880 --> 00:05:03,880
and love each other for life!

34
00:06:02,800 --> 00:06:04,240
Lord Lu is back.

35
00:06:13,560 --> 00:06:15,560
BLISS

36
00:06:30,160 --> 00:06:32,040
You're certainly making yourself at home.

37
00:06:33,720 --> 00:06:34,560
What are you reading?

38
00:06:38,720 --> 00:06:40,640
FARMING METHODS

39
00:06:40,720 --> 00:06:43,120
You're quite devoted to farming,
Your Ladyship.

40
00:06:43,840 --> 00:06:45,000
Even on our wedding night,

41
00:06:46,680 --> 00:06:47,520
you can't put it off.

42
00:06:48,320 --> 00:06:51,280
You took so long,
so I picked up something to read.

43
00:07:03,120 --> 00:07:04,280
What are you looking at?

44
00:07:05,320 --> 00:07:06,560
Just looking, like you.

45
00:07:12,080 --> 00:07:14,320
You're… You're blocking my light.

46
00:07:15,320 --> 00:07:16,280
My mistake.

47
00:07:41,840 --> 00:07:43,080
What are you reading, My Lord?

48
00:07:44,120 --> 00:07:45,120
Curious, Your Ladyship?

49
00:07:54,120 --> 00:07:55,080
It's brighter over here.

50
00:08:12,560 --> 00:08:14,840
When did you steal that? Give it back!

51
00:08:22,200 --> 00:08:23,360
That bridal booklet…

52
00:08:25,160 --> 00:08:26,800
Weren't you the one
who peeked at it first?

53
00:08:26,880 --> 00:08:27,960
Don't you dare bring it up.

54
00:08:28,880 --> 00:08:29,800
Your Ladyship.

55
00:08:31,320 --> 00:08:32,880
Don't you think I'm better than a book?

56
00:09:47,080 --> 00:09:51,120
DUKE'S RESIDENCE

57
00:09:51,200 --> 00:09:56,280
HERITAGE PRESERVED, GOODNESS PROCLAIMED

58
00:09:59,960 --> 00:10:01,560
I'll take care of it.

59
00:10:01,640 --> 00:10:03,040
But, My Lord…

60
00:10:07,120 --> 00:10:08,600
BLISS

61
00:10:48,520 --> 00:10:49,680
Time to get up.

62
00:11:15,920 --> 00:11:18,560
It's okay. I'm right here.

63
00:11:19,560 --> 00:11:21,040
What time is it?

64
00:11:21,920 --> 00:11:23,960
Shouldn't we be paying our respects
to the elders?

65
00:11:26,040 --> 00:11:27,520
I had someone apologize for us already

66
00:11:31,040 --> 00:11:32,720
The sun's already high in the sky!

67
00:11:32,800 --> 00:11:34,400
You're trying to have me laughed at.

68
00:11:34,480 --> 00:11:35,920
I did try to wake you.

69
00:11:36,760 --> 00:11:37,600
You wouldn't wake up.

70
00:11:38,440 --> 00:11:40,000
And whose fault is that?

71
00:11:41,800 --> 00:11:43,800
Go get Aman to help me get dressed.

72
00:11:44,680 --> 00:11:45,560
All right.

73
00:11:52,920 --> 00:11:54,240
The maids are too slow.

74
00:11:54,320 --> 00:11:55,840
Let me attend to you, Your Ladyship.

75
00:11:56,400 --> 00:11:58,720
Are you crazy? Put me down!

76
00:12:08,400 --> 00:12:13,080
She's the one threatened by the Han family
to falsely accuse our family.

77
00:12:13,680 --> 00:12:15,600
I hear Her Ladyship took her
as a sworn sister.

78
00:12:16,200 --> 00:12:19,080
And from now on,
she'll be living at the Duke's residence.

79
00:12:20,120 --> 00:12:22,280
Wei Rao had the nerve
to marry into this family again.

80
00:12:22,360 --> 00:12:23,840
Grandfather already disapproves of her.

81
00:12:24,600 --> 00:12:27,560
Now she's bringing in some ill-mannered
country girl with no morals.

82
00:12:27,640 --> 00:12:28,960
She's gone too far!

83
00:12:30,520 --> 00:12:32,040
Why are you bringing this up?

84
00:12:32,600 --> 00:12:34,680
Changning, don't go!

85
00:12:34,760 --> 00:12:36,560
Lady Wu'an may throw her weight
around outside,

86
00:12:36,640 --> 00:12:38,520
but once she enters the Duke's residence,

87
00:12:38,600 --> 00:12:40,480
she must obey
the family's rules and elders.

88
00:12:41,120 --> 00:12:43,520
Once Grandfather hears,
she'll be in trouble.

89
00:12:45,400 --> 00:12:46,240
Stop right there!

90
00:12:46,920 --> 00:12:49,880
You're the fraud who set up
our family at the ancestral temple.

91
00:12:49,960 --> 00:12:51,320
How dare you come here?

92
00:12:53,520 --> 00:12:54,520
Who are you people?

93
00:12:55,600 --> 00:12:56,440
Xiao!

94
00:12:59,280 --> 00:13:00,120
You're scaring her.

95
00:13:01,680 --> 00:13:03,400
Greetings, Your Ladyship.

96
00:13:04,160 --> 00:13:06,360
Xiao is my bodyguard.
He didn't scare you, did he?

97
00:13:07,040 --> 00:13:09,400
He's so crude and ill-mannered,
hardly like a bodyguard.

98
00:13:11,520 --> 00:13:12,960
When the Hutuo raided

99
00:13:13,040 --> 00:13:14,920
they seized Xiao's cattle and sheep.

100
00:13:15,440 --> 00:13:17,200
He chased them for miles and recovered

101
00:13:17,280 --> 00:13:18,840
half the herd with bare hands.

102
00:13:18,920 --> 00:13:23,000
Later, the governor robbed the people
and tried to flee the city.

103
00:13:23,080 --> 00:13:24,760
He even offered the Hutuo gold and silver.

104
00:13:26,640 --> 00:13:28,840
Xiao, what did you do?

105
00:13:28,920 --> 00:13:29,920
Chopped him into mincemeat.

106
00:13:31,280 --> 00:13:33,240
How can you keep someone like that around?

107
00:13:34,200 --> 00:13:37,240
My personal guards
are all refugees I've taken in.

108
00:13:37,920 --> 00:13:40,000
They're not bloodthirsty killers.

109
00:13:40,080 --> 00:13:42,720
This cruel world left them
no other choice.

110
00:13:43,360 --> 00:13:44,640
Don't worry.

111
00:13:44,720 --> 00:13:46,280
Xiao only cuts people up.
He doesn't eat them.

112
00:13:57,120 --> 00:13:57,960
Starting today,

113
00:13:58,880 --> 00:14:01,040
Hongxian will study etiquette with you.

114
00:14:01,720 --> 00:14:03,880
Changning, Changhui,
take good care of your new sister.

115
00:14:06,360 --> 00:14:07,720
Hongxian has only just arrived.

116
00:14:07,800 --> 00:14:09,600
She may not know
the capital's latest styles.

117
00:14:09,680 --> 00:14:12,160
I think we're about the same size.

118
00:14:12,240 --> 00:14:14,360
I have a few newly tailored dresses.

119
00:14:14,440 --> 00:14:16,280
They're all the latest styles.

120
00:14:16,360 --> 00:14:17,920
Xiao, you go and help Hongxian
answer questions.

121
00:14:19,600 --> 00:14:21,360
Aman, go with them.

122
00:14:27,480 --> 00:14:28,880
Have you decided on courtyards yet?

123
00:14:28,960 --> 00:14:31,200
Need anything? I'll get it for you.

124
00:14:31,920 --> 00:14:34,800
My Lord won't blame me
for scaring your sister, will you?

125
00:14:36,440 --> 00:14:37,280
Come on.

126
00:14:38,400 --> 00:14:39,240
I have something to show you.

127
00:14:53,880 --> 00:14:57,000
I had the servants
pull up all the flowers in this garden

128
00:14:57,080 --> 00:14:58,040
and plant alfalfa instead.

129
00:14:59,040 --> 00:15:01,080
It survives cold and drought
and grows easily.

130
00:15:01,160 --> 00:15:03,280
It makes horses strong and well-fed.

131
00:15:04,560 --> 00:15:06,960
Especially this purple alfalfa.

132
00:15:07,840 --> 00:15:09,320
Will it grow in barren hills and valleys?

133
00:15:10,200 --> 00:15:11,040
Why wouldn't it?

134
00:15:12,560 --> 00:15:13,560
Wei Rao.

135
00:15:13,640 --> 00:15:17,280
This humble weed
can turn wasteland into grazing land.

136
00:15:17,880 --> 00:15:20,440
The army needs plenty of fodder, too.

137
00:15:21,280 --> 00:15:25,480
You went to all that trouble
finding these seeds just to please me?

138
00:15:26,080 --> 00:15:28,920
Sounds like this gift
is just what you wanted.

139
00:15:38,600 --> 00:15:39,920
Your Ladyship.

140
00:15:41,480 --> 00:15:42,760
How will you thank me?

141
00:15:46,360 --> 00:15:50,520
I happen to have a fine sword
that cuts through iron like butter.

142
00:15:51,640 --> 00:15:52,960
How about I give you that?

143
00:16:02,840 --> 00:16:04,440
I've never been on a swing before.

144
00:16:04,960 --> 00:16:06,040
Give me a push.

145
00:16:20,440 --> 00:16:21,480
Where did you get that sword?

146
00:16:21,560 --> 00:16:22,640
General Qi gave it to me.

147
00:16:22,720 --> 00:16:25,200
He also gave me a bow he made himself.

148
00:16:26,000 --> 00:16:26,920
Push me higher.

149
00:16:44,120 --> 00:16:47,080
Why did you push so hard?

150
00:16:47,160 --> 00:16:48,000
Wei Rao.

151
00:16:49,800 --> 00:16:51,560
You didn't know what's love.

152
00:16:51,640 --> 00:16:55,040
Your heart is full of cold suspicion
and distrust.

153
00:16:56,360 --> 00:16:59,480
You keep testing me and hurting me.

154
00:17:00,400 --> 00:17:02,080
You tear my heart to pieces

155
00:17:03,040 --> 00:17:04,359
just to feel safe.

156
00:17:05,640 --> 00:17:07,440
But if you keep provoking me,

157
00:17:08,680 --> 00:17:11,680
there's no telling what I'll do next time.

158
00:17:13,440 --> 00:17:16,560
You knew what I was like,
yet you married me anyway.

159
00:17:17,560 --> 00:17:19,119
If you ever learn what love is,

160
00:17:22,680 --> 00:17:23,880
you'll have me by your side, and me only.

161
00:17:24,880 --> 00:17:26,720
What if I never learn,
not in this lifetime?

162
00:17:26,800 --> 00:17:27,960
Then in this lifetime,

163
00:17:28,760 --> 00:17:30,400
you'll still be mine.

164
00:17:39,800 --> 00:17:42,760
I don't know what my brother sees in her.

165
00:17:42,840 --> 00:17:46,360
He passed up the virtuous Lady Xie
to marry that temptress instead.

166
00:17:46,960 --> 00:17:48,400
Just look at the people she brought home.

167
00:17:49,000 --> 00:17:51,120
No. I'm telling Mother.

168
00:17:51,200 --> 00:17:52,480
We can't have fugitives living here.

169
00:17:53,080 --> 00:17:55,040
She has a noble title
and a fine reputation.

170
00:17:55,120 --> 00:17:56,880
Even Grandmother favors her.

171
00:17:56,960 --> 00:17:59,440
If you complain,
you'll only get yourself in trouble.

172
00:18:00,040 --> 00:18:02,160
So we just let her do whatever she wants?

173
00:18:03,160 --> 00:18:04,400
What's got you so worked up?

174
00:18:04,920 --> 00:18:06,600
My lady,
we've had little rain this spring.

175
00:18:06,680 --> 00:18:08,320
Second Madam ordered
the backyard wells cleaned.

176
00:18:08,920 --> 00:18:11,440
And in one of the wells,
we… we found a body!

177
00:18:12,040 --> 00:18:13,800
We were just about to report it
to Second Madam.

178
00:18:14,440 --> 00:18:15,280
Which well?

179
00:18:15,360 --> 00:18:16,920
The one behind Songyue Hall.

180
00:18:17,000 --> 00:18:18,400
The abandoned well in the woods.

181
00:18:22,720 --> 00:18:24,960
Come on. Let's take a look.

182
00:18:27,640 --> 00:18:28,480
Your Ladyship.

183
00:18:28,560 --> 00:18:30,480
They found something in the woods
behind Songyue Hall.

184
00:18:30,560 --> 00:18:31,920
A body.

185
00:18:41,640 --> 00:18:44,040
Your Grace. Grandmother.

186
00:18:45,160 --> 00:18:47,640
Governess Miao, tell her.

187
00:18:48,760 --> 00:18:49,640
Your Ladyship.

188
00:18:49,720 --> 00:18:52,560
The body pulled from the garden well today

189
00:18:52,640 --> 00:18:55,480
has been identified
as one of your attendants.

190
00:18:55,560 --> 00:18:56,400
Governess Wu.

191
00:18:57,360 --> 00:18:58,320
Governess Wu?

192
00:18:59,760 --> 00:19:01,000
Your Ladyship,

193
00:19:01,080 --> 00:19:03,840
you've only just married into the family.

194
00:19:03,920 --> 00:19:05,280
We shouldn't
have to trouble you with this.

195
00:19:05,880 --> 00:19:08,240
But the imperial court
issued a decree long ago.

196
00:19:08,320 --> 00:19:11,720
Anyone who abuses a servant to death
must be severely punished with a beating.

197
00:19:12,480 --> 00:19:15,640
And Governess Wu
came with you from the Wei family.

198
00:19:15,720 --> 00:19:17,720
Given her age and position,

199
00:19:17,800 --> 00:19:20,360
she deserved even greater respect.

200
00:19:20,440 --> 00:19:23,160
How could you have her killed on a whim?

201
00:19:23,800 --> 00:19:24,960
Of course, in noble households,

202
00:19:25,760 --> 00:19:28,720
a servant or two dying isn't unusual.

203
00:19:28,800 --> 00:19:30,920
The authorities don't act
unless someone reports it.

204
00:19:31,000 --> 00:19:33,040
- That's right.
- But a family like ours,

205
00:19:33,840 --> 00:19:35,480
known for honor and integrity,

206
00:19:35,560 --> 00:19:39,640
cannot afford a reputation
for abusing servants to death!

207
00:19:39,720 --> 00:19:42,120
- What a disgrace that would be!
- Enough.

208
00:19:42,800 --> 00:19:45,600
The Lu ancestors
defended the nation and its people.

209
00:19:45,680 --> 00:19:47,080
Brave generals died in battles.

210
00:19:47,720 --> 00:19:50,520
Their loyalty and courage
are still praised today.

211
00:19:50,600 --> 00:19:53,520
If our family welcomed a cruel,
murderous daughter-in-law,

212
00:19:53,600 --> 00:19:56,800
what would the world
think of the Lu family?

213
00:19:58,080 --> 00:20:00,120
We don't even know how she died.

214
00:20:00,200 --> 00:20:03,720
Perhaps she slipped
and fell into the well at night.

215
00:20:04,920 --> 00:20:05,840
Aunt.

216
00:20:06,440 --> 00:20:07,880
Those woods are deserted.

217
00:20:07,960 --> 00:20:09,760
No one ever goes there.

218
00:20:10,720 --> 00:20:12,400
If Her Ladyship did kill her by accident,

219
00:20:13,120 --> 00:20:16,200
she should admit it now
so we can decide what to do.

220
00:20:16,800 --> 00:20:18,680
If a censor brings charges later,

221
00:20:18,760 --> 00:20:20,800
we'll be ready to handle it

222
00:20:20,880 --> 00:20:23,200
without dragging my cousin into this.

223
00:20:23,280 --> 00:20:24,560
Enough.

224
00:20:25,080 --> 00:20:27,800
- What proof do you have?
- Bring it in.

225
00:20:38,320 --> 00:20:39,520
See?

226
00:20:39,600 --> 00:20:40,440
What's the meaning of this?

227
00:20:41,440 --> 00:20:43,120
The silver needle
was inserted into her throat.

228
00:20:43,200 --> 00:20:45,080
It came out completely black.

229
00:20:45,160 --> 00:20:48,000
Governess Wu was clearly poisoned!

230
00:20:52,440 --> 00:20:55,680
If you had nothing to do with her death,

231
00:20:55,760 --> 00:20:59,440
why were you so certain
she'd returned to the Wei residence?

232
00:21:04,480 --> 00:21:07,800
Rao, dear, what on earth happened?

233
00:21:09,800 --> 00:21:11,400
I'll smash your head in!

234
00:21:16,040 --> 00:21:17,960
I do owe this family an explanation.

235
00:21:19,640 --> 00:21:20,960
- That's…
- You're asking the wrong person!

236
00:21:26,120 --> 00:21:27,200
You should be asking me.

237
00:21:33,320 --> 00:21:34,400
Grandfather, Grandmother.

238
00:21:35,080 --> 00:21:36,200
There's no need to pressure Wei Rao.

239
00:21:37,720 --> 00:21:38,640
She's taking the blame for me.

240
00:21:43,680 --> 00:21:44,800
Taking the blame for you?

241
00:21:47,440 --> 00:21:50,520
That old woman snuck into my study
and tried to read my military reports.

242
00:21:51,280 --> 00:21:53,720
Zhao Song caught her in the act.
She took poison and killed herself.

243
00:21:54,480 --> 00:21:56,040
I meant to have her body removed,

244
00:21:56,120 --> 00:21:57,760
but I didn't want to alert
her accomplices.

245
00:21:58,280 --> 00:21:59,680
I feared the news
would upset Her Ladyship.

246
00:21:59,760 --> 00:22:01,080
So I had the body disposed quietly.

247
00:22:02,400 --> 00:22:04,680
After that, I suspected
there were more spies in the residence.

248
00:22:04,760 --> 00:22:08,040
- So I set a trap to catch them.
- My dear.

249
00:22:12,200 --> 00:22:13,240
I know you can't bear to do it.

250
00:22:13,320 --> 00:22:15,200
But national security was at stake.

251
00:22:15,280 --> 00:22:18,360
Leaving her body intact
was already more mercy than she deserved.

252
00:22:19,000 --> 00:22:20,000
Zhuo.

253
00:22:20,080 --> 00:22:21,480
Even if that old woman was a spy,

254
00:22:22,080 --> 00:22:23,760
she served Her Ladyship.

255
00:22:23,840 --> 00:22:26,200
How can you say
she had nothing to do with it?

256
00:22:29,960 --> 00:22:31,280
What else are you suggesting?

257
00:22:32,240 --> 00:22:34,400
- That Wei Rao is a spy, too?
- I…

258
00:22:34,480 --> 00:22:35,440
If she were a spy,

259
00:22:35,520 --> 00:22:37,960
Han Liao would've framed
the Lu family successfully.

260
00:22:38,040 --> 00:22:39,760
You wouldn't be standing here
spouting nonsense!

261
00:22:41,600 --> 00:22:43,200
I spoke out of turn.

262
00:22:43,800 --> 00:22:47,000
But I was only
looking out for you and the Lu family.

263
00:22:48,160 --> 00:22:49,440
What's so surprising about that?

264
00:22:50,040 --> 00:22:53,080
Even in Lu Zhuo's Songyue Hall,
that servant Anfu

265
00:22:53,160 --> 00:22:54,440
was bribed into a traitor, right?

266
00:22:55,040 --> 00:22:58,440
Traitors are everywhere.
You can never be too careful.

267
00:22:59,640 --> 00:23:01,400
Rao, none of this is your fault.

268
00:23:01,480 --> 00:23:03,320
I'm sorry you had such a fright.

269
00:23:05,120 --> 00:23:06,120
Thank you, Grandmother.

270
00:23:06,960 --> 00:23:09,960
When I learned my servant had done wrong,
I was terrified.

271
00:23:10,560 --> 00:23:12,560
I should've told the elders sooner.

272
00:23:12,640 --> 00:23:14,000
The misunderstanding today
could be avoided.

273
00:23:16,040 --> 00:23:18,760
She was a spy. Killing her was justified.

274
00:23:18,840 --> 00:23:21,360
You couldn't even get the facts straight.

275
00:23:21,440 --> 00:23:22,800
Is this how you run the household?

276
00:23:22,880 --> 00:23:24,560
You've made fools of us all.

277
00:23:24,640 --> 00:23:27,040
I… I failed to look into it properly.

278
00:23:27,120 --> 00:23:29,280
I nearly accused an innocent woman.

279
00:23:29,360 --> 00:23:30,400
Please forgive me.

280
00:23:33,560 --> 00:23:34,800
I'm at fault, too.

281
00:23:34,880 --> 00:23:36,480
I should've asked Lu Zhuo first.

282
00:23:36,560 --> 00:23:37,640
Yes.

283
00:23:37,720 --> 00:23:41,360
An upright heart leads to upright conduct.

284
00:23:41,440 --> 00:23:42,480
Enough.

285
00:23:43,000 --> 00:23:44,480
The matter is settled.

286
00:23:44,560 --> 00:23:45,600
You may all leave.

287
00:23:50,800 --> 00:23:51,880
What are you around for?

288
00:23:51,960 --> 00:23:53,600
Waiting for a reward?

289
00:23:59,120 --> 00:24:00,040
Rao.

290
00:24:00,920 --> 00:24:03,200
Come rest with me.

291
00:24:04,520 --> 00:24:05,520
Pay them no mind.

292
00:24:05,600 --> 00:24:08,920
Don't let such petty troubles
weigh on your heart.

293
00:24:19,200 --> 00:24:21,280
What's gotten into you, child?
What were you thinking?

294
00:24:21,360 --> 00:24:24,000
Back in the hall, you didn't stand up
for your cousin-in-law.

295
00:24:24,080 --> 00:24:26,080
Instead, you stirred up trouble
for an outsider!

296
00:24:26,160 --> 00:24:29,320
Aunt. It was only a servant who died.

297
00:24:29,400 --> 00:24:32,080
Do you really think the court
would punish Her Ladyship for that?

298
00:24:33,200 --> 00:24:36,600
They made a fuss
just to put Her Ladyship in her place

299
00:24:37,200 --> 00:24:39,200
so she wouldn't be so overbearing.

300
00:24:40,240 --> 00:24:43,480
Aunt. I was looking out for you, too.

301
00:24:43,560 --> 00:24:44,800
A daughter-in-law
outranking her mother-in-law,

302
00:24:44,880 --> 00:24:45,920
and doing whatever she pleases,

303
00:24:46,000 --> 00:24:47,520
is bound to cause trouble someday.

304
00:24:49,280 --> 00:24:50,400
If Mother keeps listening to her schemes,

305
00:24:51,000 --> 00:24:52,800
there'll be no end to the trouble.

306
00:24:52,880 --> 00:24:54,920
- Zhuo, you've misunderstood.
- Mother.

307
00:24:55,640 --> 00:24:57,320
Weiyu belongs to the He family.

308
00:24:57,400 --> 00:24:58,880
It's time she went back to her family.

309
00:24:59,480 --> 00:25:01,400
Let Uncle arrange a marriage for her.

310
00:25:01,480 --> 00:25:04,840
Zhuo, what… what did I do wrong?

311
00:25:04,920 --> 00:25:05,840
Are you sending me away?

312
00:25:06,440 --> 00:25:07,920
Aunt, you…

313
00:25:08,720 --> 00:25:12,560
Zhuo, dear.
Your cousin Weiyu grew up by my side.

314
00:25:12,640 --> 00:25:15,520
She's no different
from my own daughter now.

315
00:25:15,600 --> 00:25:18,000
She's young and doesn't know any better.

316
00:25:18,080 --> 00:25:21,840
She said some foolish things, but surely
that's no reason to send her away.

317
00:25:21,920 --> 00:25:22,880
I'm trying to save her.

318
00:25:23,560 --> 00:25:26,400
Wei Rao's maids are
mostly palace old-timers.

319
00:25:26,920 --> 00:25:27,880
Lady Li sent them

320
00:25:28,480 --> 00:25:30,440
to make sure her daughter
was treated well.

321
00:25:31,080 --> 00:25:32,600
You stirred up trouble against her.

322
00:25:32,680 --> 00:25:35,080
and accused Her Ladyship
of killing a servant.

323
00:25:35,680 --> 00:25:37,200
If word reaches the palace tomorrow,

324
00:25:38,160 --> 00:25:39,960
what do you think will happen to you?

325
00:25:40,040 --> 00:25:42,320
Zhuo, I didn't!

326
00:25:42,920 --> 00:25:43,960
Please save me!

327
00:25:44,680 --> 00:25:45,720
Weiyu!

328
00:25:45,800 --> 00:25:49,320
Rao's mother adores her daughter.

329
00:25:49,400 --> 00:25:50,480
How could you be so foolish?

330
00:25:51,280 --> 00:25:54,160
Zhuo, I understand what you're saying.

331
00:25:54,240 --> 00:25:57,480
I'll write to my brother at once
and have him take her home.

332
00:25:57,560 --> 00:25:59,240
Until the He family comes for her,

333
00:25:59,320 --> 00:26:00,760
I'll keep her to her room.

334
00:26:00,840 --> 00:26:02,400
She won't be allowed to wander around.

335
00:26:03,120 --> 00:26:09,880
Could you do me a favor
and apologize to Rao on Weiyu's behalf?

336
00:26:09,960 --> 00:26:12,360
- Aunt!
- Please, say no more.

337
00:26:12,960 --> 00:26:15,840
Weiyu may be foolish,
but at least Mother knows better.

338
00:26:16,440 --> 00:26:18,120
- I know. I know.
- Zhuo!

339
00:26:18,200 --> 00:26:19,320
I did it because I love you.

340
00:26:19,400 --> 00:26:21,280
That's why I said those things.

341
00:26:21,360 --> 00:26:23,120
But I haven't done anything serious.

342
00:26:23,200 --> 00:26:25,680
I know I was wrong! I really do!

343
00:26:25,760 --> 00:26:27,360
Zhuo! You…

344
00:26:27,440 --> 00:26:28,800
I'll leave her alone from now on.

345
00:26:29,560 --> 00:26:31,800
I worked so hard to keep her by my side.

346
00:26:32,320 --> 00:26:33,360
And you tried to drive her away

347
00:26:34,080 --> 00:26:35,720
and come between my wife and me.

348
00:26:35,800 --> 00:26:36,840
That is unforgivable.

349
00:26:38,040 --> 00:26:39,320
Send her back soon.

350
00:26:39,840 --> 00:26:40,840
I don't want to see her again.

351
00:26:41,480 --> 00:26:42,480
Zhuo!

352
00:26:43,040 --> 00:26:45,720
- Zhuo! My cousin!
- That's enough! Stop.

353
00:26:45,800 --> 00:26:46,800
Be quiet!

354
00:27:06,960 --> 00:27:08,360
No matter who you're angry with,

355
00:27:08,440 --> 00:27:10,440
don't take it out on your health.

356
00:27:13,920 --> 00:27:15,760
Rice porridge is good for your stomach.

357
00:27:15,840 --> 00:27:16,880
At least have a little.

358
00:27:28,480 --> 00:27:29,440
Why?

359
00:27:33,680 --> 00:27:34,920
Who asked you to lie for me?

360
00:27:39,160 --> 00:27:40,120
Try it.

361
00:27:41,600 --> 00:27:42,560
Answer me.

362
00:27:43,800 --> 00:27:44,680
Answer what?

363
00:27:46,120 --> 00:27:47,160
That night,

364
00:27:48,080 --> 00:27:49,160
<i>by the well,</i>

365
00:27:49,840 --> 00:27:51,280
<i>you clearly saw me there.</i>

366
00:27:51,880 --> 00:27:53,080
<i>I lied to you.</i>

367
00:27:53,600 --> 00:27:56,040
<i>Don't you want to know</i>
<i>how Governess Wu died?</i>

368
00:27:56,720 --> 00:27:59,760
Maybe I was afraid
she'd expose my identity,

369
00:27:59,840 --> 00:28:01,520
so I killed her to keep her quiet.

370
00:28:01,600 --> 00:28:02,800
Lu Zhuo!

371
00:28:02,880 --> 00:28:05,680
You covered for me without even asking!

372
00:28:06,880 --> 00:28:07,800
Because I trust you.

373
00:28:10,120 --> 00:28:11,480
You'd never harm the innocent.

374
00:28:16,480 --> 00:28:20,520
You're a man of honor,
with integrity beyond reproach.

375
00:28:21,040 --> 00:28:22,040
Please don't do it again.

376
00:28:23,080 --> 00:28:24,160
Don't do what?

377
00:28:26,000 --> 00:28:27,520
Don't keep giving in for my sake.

378
00:28:28,800 --> 00:28:30,680
Don't compromise your principles for me.

379
00:28:31,200 --> 00:28:32,480
And don't lie for me again.

380
00:28:41,800 --> 00:28:45,160
Everyone wants the person they love
to be sincere and innocent,

381
00:28:45,680 --> 00:28:47,000
kind and selfless.

382
00:28:48,960 --> 00:28:49,800
But that's not who you are.

383
00:28:51,520 --> 00:28:52,920
And that's fine.

384
00:28:54,000 --> 00:28:58,200
Whether you had no other choice
or you're coldhearted by nature,

385
00:29:02,880 --> 00:29:04,000
as long as it's you,

386
00:29:05,640 --> 00:29:06,760
I'll always help you.

387
00:29:16,640 --> 00:29:21,760
Marriages between noble families
are built on mutual respect and courtesy.

388
00:29:22,480 --> 00:29:25,760
When hardship strikes,
the families could support each other,

389
00:29:25,840 --> 00:29:27,280
and that's enough for a good marriage.

390
00:29:27,360 --> 00:29:28,520
You…

391
00:29:32,600 --> 00:29:33,800
You don't have to be so good to me.

392
00:29:34,920 --> 00:29:36,160
Wei Rao.

393
00:29:36,240 --> 00:29:38,240
Crossing boundaries means losing control!

394
00:29:38,320 --> 00:29:39,560
And I hate losing control!

395
00:29:49,200 --> 00:29:51,240
I'm sure the Duke
has warned you repeatedly

396
00:29:52,040 --> 00:29:53,960
not to get carried away by romance.

397
00:29:54,040 --> 00:29:55,840
We must listen to our elders.

398
00:29:56,360 --> 00:29:58,720
I've sent your military books
and bedding to the study.

399
00:29:59,440 --> 00:30:01,160
You're heartless.

400
00:30:01,240 --> 00:30:04,520
We're newlyweds,
and you're already kicking me out?

401
00:30:04,600 --> 00:30:08,120
Your noble families believe
too much indulgence shortens one's life.

402
00:30:09,280 --> 00:30:11,800
From now on, we should share a bed
on the first and fifteenth of each month.

403
00:30:12,840 --> 00:30:14,680
I'm tired. You may go, My Lord.

404
00:30:15,720 --> 00:30:16,960
It's only been two days.

405
00:30:20,920 --> 00:30:22,520
Good night, My Lord.

406
00:30:33,760 --> 00:30:38,000
HERITAGE PRESERVED, GOODNESS PROCLAIMED

407
00:31:02,400 --> 00:31:03,760
You're certainly on your guard,
Your Ladyship.

408
00:31:05,600 --> 00:31:06,800
Get off the bed.

409
00:31:06,880 --> 00:31:08,520
You know I can help you.

410
00:31:08,600 --> 00:31:10,200
You should be holding on to me.

411
00:31:10,280 --> 00:31:11,640
Why do you keep pushing me away?

412
00:31:12,800 --> 00:31:14,440
What are you so afraid of?

413
00:31:15,120 --> 00:31:16,480
That you'll depend on me too much?

414
00:31:17,000 --> 00:31:17,960
Or…

415
00:31:19,880 --> 00:31:21,240
Are you afraid falling in love with me?

416
00:31:27,640 --> 00:31:29,800
You think awfully highly of yourself,
My Lord.

417
00:31:40,040 --> 00:31:41,320
Well, I'm not leaving.

418
00:31:47,200 --> 00:31:48,720
I told you not to marry me.

419
00:31:50,560 --> 00:31:54,000
Tell me, what kind of couple
is as strange as we are?

420
00:31:54,680 --> 00:31:56,800
Then we'll be a strange couple.

421
00:31:57,720 --> 00:32:01,720
You can hate me or refuse to love me
for the rest of your life.

422
00:32:01,800 --> 00:32:03,880
We can fight every single day.

423
00:32:05,280 --> 00:32:06,880
I'll still hold you in my arms.

424
00:32:08,840 --> 00:32:10,240
Let's get by together.

425
00:32:10,320 --> 00:32:11,880
A lifetime between you and me.

426
00:32:12,480 --> 00:32:14,720
- How is that not love?
- You…

427
00:32:16,760 --> 00:32:17,920
I'm tired.

428
00:32:24,480 --> 00:32:26,200
<i>You brought this on yourself.</i>

429
00:32:26,920 --> 00:32:30,400
<i>Once I claim something as mine,</i>
<i>I'd rather die than let it go.</i>

430
00:32:31,840 --> 00:32:33,840
<i>So never ask me to let you go.</i>

431
00:32:34,440 --> 00:32:36,280
<i>Not in this life or any other.</i>

432
00:32:56,760 --> 00:32:58,000
What's wrong?

433
00:32:59,720 --> 00:33:01,040
You're freezing cold, My Lord.

434
00:33:01,120 --> 00:33:02,520
I don't want to sleep next to you.

435
00:33:02,600 --> 00:33:03,960
Go sleep at the other end.

436
00:33:13,160 --> 00:33:16,040
I forgot you can't stand the cold.
My mistake.

437
00:33:23,040 --> 00:33:25,360
Allow me to warm your bed, Your Ladyship.

438
00:33:25,440 --> 00:33:26,560
Lu Zhuo!

439
00:33:38,480 --> 00:33:41,040
DUKE'S RESIDENCE

440
00:33:56,000 --> 00:33:59,120
Your Ladyship lends grain to the villagers
using a large measure,

441
00:33:59,200 --> 00:34:00,640
but asks to repay with a smaller one.

442
00:34:01,240 --> 00:34:02,600
To thank Your Ladyship,

443
00:34:02,680 --> 00:34:04,480
they pick the freshest wild greens
in the hills

444
00:34:04,560 --> 00:34:06,280
and carry them all the way into town.

445
00:34:06,360 --> 00:34:08,560
You refuse them,
so they leave the greens and run.

446
00:34:09,080 --> 00:34:12,000
They bring more every day.
What should we do?

447
00:34:18,520 --> 00:34:20,080
Your Ladyship, the Fourth Prince is here.

448
00:34:20,159 --> 00:34:21,080
Rao!

449
00:34:21,840 --> 00:34:22,760
Rao!

450
00:34:24,199 --> 00:34:25,239
Put them down.

451
00:34:26,520 --> 00:34:27,560
Rao.

452
00:34:27,639 --> 00:34:29,560
These fresh oranges
are tribute from the south.

453
00:34:29,639 --> 00:34:31,320
Mother told me to bring them all to you.

454
00:34:33,480 --> 00:34:34,880
That's a lot of wild greens.

455
00:34:34,960 --> 00:34:36,000
Can you eat them all, Rao?

456
00:34:36,679 --> 00:34:38,120
No, I can't. Take them with you.

457
00:34:40,000 --> 00:34:41,080
Your Highness.

458
00:34:41,159 --> 00:34:43,000
You are not here only for the oranges,
right?

459
00:34:43,960 --> 00:34:45,719
Nothing gets past you, Zhuo.

460
00:34:46,560 --> 00:34:49,239
The palace is hosting a spring banquet.
I was sent to invite you, my sister.

461
00:34:50,679 --> 00:34:51,880
Come, Rao.

462
00:34:53,600 --> 00:34:55,400
Lady Zheng wants to host

463
00:34:55,480 --> 00:34:56,679
a peace offering between you
and the Crown Princess.

464
00:34:57,280 --> 00:34:58,520
A peace offering?

465
00:34:59,240 --> 00:35:02,040
On the Spring Purification Festival,
you may bring her to the palace with you.

466
00:35:02,120 --> 00:35:04,520
Have a drink together
and bury the hatchet.

467
00:35:04,600 --> 00:35:05,640
Then Mother can be at ease.

468
00:35:08,080 --> 00:35:09,440
And this peace offering…

469
00:35:10,200 --> 00:35:11,040
Am I invited?

470
00:35:11,840 --> 00:35:13,520
It's a spring banquet
for the palace ladies.

471
00:35:13,600 --> 00:35:15,360
You're of course not invited.

472
00:35:15,440 --> 00:35:18,000
But Mother will be there,
so you have nothing to worry about.

473
00:35:20,040 --> 00:35:22,200
Since Lady Zheng has been so gracious,

474
00:35:23,960 --> 00:35:25,040
I'd be happy to accept.

475
00:35:26,960 --> 00:35:28,280
Take these baskets to the kitchen.

476
00:35:28,880 --> 00:35:31,160
Mulberries spoil quickly.
Share them with everyone.

477
00:35:31,680 --> 00:35:32,640
Yes.

478
00:35:37,000 --> 00:35:40,000
Every time I go to the palace,
something bad happens.

479
00:35:42,240 --> 00:35:44,920
Lady Zheng's brother, Zheng Tan,
is clever and capable.

480
00:35:45,720 --> 00:35:49,480
But the younger generation
is mostly mediocre and spoiled.

481
00:35:50,000 --> 00:35:51,000
Not one fit for major roles.

482
00:35:57,040 --> 00:35:58,000
Now you've married me,

483
00:35:59,280 --> 00:36:00,800
the Zheng family is even more anxious.

484
00:36:03,040 --> 00:36:05,880
You're that intimidating, Lord Lu?

485
00:36:06,800 --> 00:36:08,400
Then I should've married you sooner.

486
00:36:11,160 --> 00:36:12,840
Whatever they're planning,

487
00:36:13,720 --> 00:36:16,800
we'll deal with it when the time comes.

488
00:36:28,200 --> 00:36:30,520
These oranges are sweet and tangy.
Want to try one?

489
00:36:34,480 --> 00:36:35,520
Here, take it.

490
00:36:49,920 --> 00:36:51,120
Lady Hongxian.

491
00:36:55,240 --> 00:36:56,440
Here.

492
00:37:16,000 --> 00:37:18,520
SPRING PURIFICATION FESTIVAL

493
00:37:27,320 --> 00:37:28,520
Your Highness.

494
00:37:28,600 --> 00:37:31,760
I hear you have grown close
to the Crown Princess lately.

495
00:37:32,440 --> 00:37:34,880
Forgive me for saying this,
but the Crown Princess is no kind soul.

496
00:37:35,640 --> 00:37:38,120
You're beautiful, gentle and gracious.

497
00:37:38,720 --> 00:37:41,880
Don't let her manipulate you
into making trouble for my sister.

498
00:37:43,120 --> 00:37:44,960
You've been spying on me, Your Highness.

499
00:37:45,040 --> 00:37:46,640
Now you have the nerve to question me?

500
00:37:47,680 --> 00:37:50,360
Your sister is ambitious and arrogant.

501
00:37:50,440 --> 00:37:51,720
Why should I put up with her?

502
00:37:53,920 --> 00:37:56,160
While you practiced music
and painting beneath the wisteria,

503
00:37:56,680 --> 00:37:59,000
my sister's hands
were raw from forced labor.

504
00:37:59,520 --> 00:38:00,840
The world has never been kind to her.

505
00:38:01,440 --> 00:38:03,920
Yet she gives everything
she has to help those in need.

506
00:38:05,200 --> 00:38:08,160
How can you bring yourself
to hurt someone like her, Hualou?

507
00:38:09,440 --> 00:38:11,160
Your sister stole the man I love.

508
00:38:12,560 --> 00:38:15,240
Is my brother-in-law the only brave,
handsome man in the world?

509
00:38:16,400 --> 00:38:17,720
Beautiful as you are,

510
00:38:17,800 --> 00:38:20,240
surely you can find another husband.

511
00:38:22,080 --> 00:38:23,520
Don't you know?

512
00:38:24,040 --> 00:38:25,640
I'm about to marry Prince Fu.

513
00:38:26,160 --> 00:38:27,200
I don't have a choice.

514
00:38:28,040 --> 00:38:31,120
If you want a husband of noble birth,

515
00:38:32,640 --> 00:38:35,160
am I not a prince, too?

516
00:38:36,920 --> 00:38:38,200
Have you lost your mind?

517
00:38:38,280 --> 00:38:40,120
You're four years younger than me!

518
00:38:40,200 --> 00:38:41,600
How dare you toy with me like this?

519
00:38:42,520 --> 00:38:46,360
A beautiful lady like you
has a heart worth more than gold.

520
00:38:47,400 --> 00:38:50,440
Even if you've done something wrong,
someone else must have led you astray.

521
00:38:55,400 --> 00:38:56,320
Promise me.

522
00:38:56,960 --> 00:38:58,240
Don't go against your own heart

523
00:38:58,840 --> 00:39:00,800
just to make an enemy of my sister.

524
00:39:00,880 --> 00:39:02,000
Please?

525
00:39:07,040 --> 00:39:10,280
If you'll only give me a chance, Hualou,
what's a four-year age gap?

526
00:39:10,360 --> 00:39:12,080
Age difference wouldn't matter.

527
00:39:12,160 --> 00:39:13,360
I wouldn't care.

528
00:39:28,320 --> 00:39:30,360
- That was so close! Try again.
- So close!

529
00:39:31,120 --> 00:39:32,240
Go play with them.

530
00:39:50,400 --> 00:39:51,480
Lady Li.

531
00:39:52,640 --> 00:39:53,720
Lady Zheng.

532
00:39:53,800 --> 00:39:55,200
AUSPICIOUS DAYS, JOYOUS GATHERINGS

533
00:39:55,280 --> 00:39:56,200
Lady Wang.

534
00:39:56,720 --> 00:39:57,760
Rao.

535
00:40:03,120 --> 00:40:04,640
You needn't trouble yourself,
Crown Princess.

536
00:40:04,720 --> 00:40:06,720
We're sisters.
Rank doesn't matter between us.

537
00:40:07,480 --> 00:40:09,840
Things have been tense between us lately.

538
00:40:09,920 --> 00:40:11,320
As your older sister, I was at fault.

539
00:40:11,400 --> 00:40:13,680
I was thoughtless and hurt your feelings.

540
00:40:14,680 --> 00:40:16,360
I sincerely apologize.

541
00:40:16,440 --> 00:40:18,240
I hope you'll find it in your heart

542
00:40:18,320 --> 00:40:22,000
to put our differences behind us
so we can be close again.

543
00:40:24,440 --> 00:40:27,200
Everyone knows your sister is generous.

544
00:40:27,280 --> 00:40:29,760
Besides, you both bear the Wei name.

545
00:40:29,840 --> 00:40:30,720
You're family, after all.

546
00:40:30,800 --> 00:40:36,240
Making such a grand apology
only makes her seem petty.

547
00:40:41,960 --> 00:40:43,200
Thank you.

548
00:40:50,400 --> 00:40:53,000
Rao, you must be tired. Go sit down.

549
00:41:02,920 --> 00:41:05,240
Rao. You haven't met her yet.

550
00:41:06,200 --> 00:41:07,240
This is Yi Jiang.

551
00:41:07,320 --> 00:41:08,960
She serves Prince Fu.

552
00:41:09,560 --> 00:41:11,520
She's skilled at divination
and reading faces.

553
00:41:11,600 --> 00:41:16,840
Just now, she even helped Lady Wang
find her missing pearl bracelet.

554
00:41:16,920 --> 00:41:19,080
Yi Jiang, come here.

555
00:41:20,120 --> 00:41:21,840
Read my Rao's face, would you?

556
00:41:23,960 --> 00:41:24,840
Yes, Your Ladyship.

557
00:41:28,440 --> 00:41:29,520
Greetings, Your Ladyship.

558
00:41:30,160 --> 00:41:31,280
No need for formalities.

559
00:41:32,280 --> 00:41:33,120
YI JIANG, PRINCE FU'S FAVORITE CONCUBINE

560
00:41:33,200 --> 00:41:35,800
Your forehead is broad.
Your eyes shine like morning stars.

561
00:41:36,600 --> 00:41:39,480
That shows wisdom, clarity,
and keen insight.

562
00:41:39,560 --> 00:41:42,400
Your upper features are open,
and your jaw commands respect.

563
00:41:42,480 --> 00:41:44,200
You were born for greatness.

564
00:41:45,320 --> 00:41:46,320
Thank you for your kind words.

565
00:41:47,560 --> 00:41:48,960
Your Highness once had a sister.

566
00:41:49,880 --> 00:41:51,560
Your fates are at odds.

567
00:41:52,240 --> 00:41:55,400
Like two stars that never share the sky,

568
00:41:55,480 --> 00:41:58,400
you must never meet again
if you wish to live.

569
00:41:58,920 --> 00:42:00,560
Otherwise…

570
00:42:00,640 --> 00:42:01,800
Otherwise what?

571
00:42:02,960 --> 00:42:05,760
Your Highness already knows the answer.

572
00:42:06,920 --> 00:42:08,120
There's more.

573
00:42:08,200 --> 00:42:10,640
You face three deadly trials
in your lifetime.

574
00:42:10,720 --> 00:42:12,280
Each time, more dangerous than the last.

575
00:42:12,880 --> 00:42:16,360
I pray you earn enough good fortune
to survive them all.

576
00:42:28,560 --> 00:42:30,120
Deadly trials?

577
00:42:30,200 --> 00:42:31,920
What if she can't get through it?

578
00:42:32,000 --> 00:42:33,760
Bloodshed and death hang over her.

579
00:42:34,760 --> 00:42:36,880
If she cannot get through it,

580
00:42:36,960 --> 00:42:39,720
then I'm afraid
her death is fast approaching.

581
00:42:39,800 --> 00:42:42,760
She will not live past her twenties.

582
00:44:57,320 --> 00:44:59,440
‪NO ANIMALS WERE HARMED
‪IN THE MAKING OF THIS SHOW
